## Formula de Calculo ST Saida

```
ICMS Proprio  = Valor Total NF x Aliq. Interestadual
Base ST       = Valor Total NF x (1 + MVA / 100)
ICMS-ST Reter = (Base ST x Aliq. Interna) - ICMS Proprio
               [se negativo -> zera: nao existe ST negativa]
Total NF      = Valor Mercadoria + Frete + ICMS-ST
```

